	<<npc Riley>><<person1>>
	You pay the receptionist, who barely glances at you before nodding toward the gym floor. The smell of sweat and rubber mats hits you as you step inside. The place is all business—heavy bags hanging from the ceiling, a ring in the center, and fighters working through their drills.  

	It's easy to pick out the coach. Hands on hips, <<he>> watches a pair of students spar, <<his>> sharp gaze catching every mistake. <<His>> stance is relaxed but commanding, like someone who's been in more fights than they care to count.  

	<br><br>
	The door swings shut behind you, catching <<his>> attention. They turn, black eyes locking onto you with a look that sizes you up in a second. "New blood, huh?" <<His>> voice is rough, but not unkind. "Hope you're not here for some light cardio."  

	Short, slightly messy undercut dark brown hair and a little sweat-damp, frames a weathered but sharp face. <<His>> athletic frame is lean and scarred, the kind of body built from hard fights and harder lessons. <<His>> gear is simple—hand wraps, a sleeveless hoodie, and fight shorts—worn but well-used.  

	<<if $NPCList[0].breastsize gte 5>>
		Despite <<his>> hardened appearance, <<his>> generous breasts are bound tight, keeping them streamlined for movement.
	<<elseif $NPCList[0].breastsize gte 3>>
